# Deliberately empty, and deliberately COMMITTED.
#
# Mounting ./provisioning over /etc/grafana/provisioning replaces the whole
# directory, so the image's own empty alerting/ folder disappears and Grafana logs
# at level=error on every single start:
#   "can't read alerting provisioning files from directory ... no such file or
#    directory"
# Nothing is broken. But an error line that is always there and always fine is
# how a log stops being read, which is the same disease as an alert nobody
# receives -- and this stack has already paid for that one (#56).
